00:07:40.388 --> 00:07:42.356
MEANING THAT IT WILL BE MADE OF

00:07:42.357 --> 00:07:44.024
U.S. STEEL, AMERICAN STEEL.

00:07:44.025 --> 00:07:45.225
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE HAS COMPROMISED.

00:07:45.226 --> 00:07:49.296
THEY ARE NOT TO COMPROMISE.

00:07:49.297 --> 00:07:49.997
&gt;&gt; THIS IS IMPORTANT BECAUSE

00:07:49.998 --> 00:07:52.065
MANY PEOPLE SAY YOU SHOULD SEE

00:07:52.066 --> 00:07:52.633
THROUGH IT.

00:07:52.634 --> 00:07:54.301
CUSTOMS AND BORDER PATROL SO YOU

00:07:54.302 --> 00:07:55.502
NEED TO SEE THROUGH IT.

00:07:55.503 --> 00:07:56.703
&gt;&gt; Laura: I DON'T GET IT.

00:07:56.704 --> 00:07:58.605
&gt;&gt; THEY NEED TO SEE WHAT'S ON

00:07:58.606 --> 00:07:59.373
THE OTHER SIDE.

00:07:59.374 --> 00:08:00.841
THE PRESIDENT IS LISTENING TO

00:08:00.842 --> 00:08:02.076
THEM.

